  },
  "body": "This changes the document-conformance requirements for the `link` element such that it’s conforming for it to have a `sizes` attribute if it has `rel=apple-touch-icon` (instead of `rel=icon`). But this doesn’t change any UA requirements; instead it includes a note that (unlike for `rel=icon`), UAs are not actually required to do anything for `rel=apple-touch-icon`.",
